{"sha": "90cc48999684cb7d713be8f92b70abfc216898b69369c3ab2275bcc620e02e6c", "body": ["\\chapter{正方体与长方体}\\label{ch:g5:solids}", "", "告别平面：立体图形是现实世界中的形状 ---", "骰子、麦片盒、罐头、球。本章学习给它们命名，", "数一数它们的面和棱，把它们展开成展开图，并", "通过数小正方体来测量它们的体积。（体积公式见", "\\cref{ch:g6:measure}）", "", "\\section{立体图形家族}", "", "\\begin{definition}[立体图形及其相关词汇]\\label{def:g5:solids:def}", "占据空间的物体称为\\emph{立体图形}\\index{立体图形}。平的侧面称为", "\\emph{面}\\index{面}，面与面相交于\\emph{棱}\\index{棱}；", "棱与棱相交于\\emph{顶点}\\index{顶点}。", "这一家族的成员如下：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{正方体}\\index{正方体}：$6$ 个正方形的面，$12$ 条棱，", "        $8$ 个顶点；", "  \\item \\emph{长方体}\\index{长方体}：$6$ 个长方形的面，", "        $12$ 条棱，$8$ 个顶点；", "  \\item \\emph{圆柱}\\index{圆柱}：两个圆面和一个", "        侧面（如罐头）；", "  \\item \\emph{棱锥}\\index{棱锥}：一个多边形底面和若干三角形，它们交于", "        同一个顶点；", "  \\item \\emph{球}：一个完全圆滑的曲面，", "        没有面，没有棱。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  % cube", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,1.8);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.8) -- (0.7,2.5) -- (2.5,2.5) -- (1.8,1.8);", "  \\draw[thick] (2.5,2.5) -- (2.5,0.7) -- (1.8,0);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.2,-0.3) {正方体};", "  % box", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.4cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (2.8,1.4);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.4) -- (0.6,2.0) -- (3.4,2.0) -- (2.8,1.4);", "  \\draw[thick] (3.4,2.0) -- (3.4,0.6) -- (2.8,0);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.7,-0.3) {长方体};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % cylinder", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=9.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0.35) ellipse (0.85 and 0.3);", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.85,0.35) -- (-0.85,2.2);", "  \\draw[thick] (0.85,0.35) -- (0.85,2.2);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,2.2) ellipse (0.85 and 0.3);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.3) {圆柱};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % pyramid", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=12.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.9,0.2) -- (0.9,0.2) -- (1.35,0.75) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.9,0.2) -- (0.15,2.4) -- (0.9,0.2);", "  \\draw[thick] (1.35,0.75) -- (0.15,2.4);", "  \\draw[dashed] (-0.9,0.2) -- (-0.45,0.75) -- (1.35,0.75);", "  \\draw[dashed] (-0.45,0.75) -- (0.15,2.4);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.2,-0.3) {棱锥};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % ball", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=16.4cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.2) circle (1.1);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,1.2) ellipse (1.1 and 0.35);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.3) {球};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 立体图形展览。虚线表示看不见的棱 ---", "即立体图形背面的棱，仿佛透过立体图形看到。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[数一数正方体]\\label{ex:g5:solids:count}", "数一数骰子：$6$ 个面（标有数字 $1$ 到 $6$），$8$ 个", "顶点（即角），$12$ 条棱（用手指沿着棱划一划：上面 $4$ 条，", "下面 $4$ 条，竖着的 $4$ 条）。还有", "$6 + 8 = 12 + 2$ --- 这一奇妙规律对长方体和", "棱锥也成立，见\\cref{ex:g8:solids:count}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{展开图}", "", "\\begin{definition}[展开图]\\label{def:g5:solids:net}", "立体图形的\\emph{展开图}\\index{展开图}是其所有面的平面画法，", "各面沿棱相连，可折叠成该立体图形 ---", "即把立体图形像回收前压平的纸箱一样拆开。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]", "  \\draw[gray!40, thin] (0,0) grid (4,3);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (0,1) rectangle (1,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (1,1) rectangle (2,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (2,1) rectangle (3,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (3,1) rectangle (4,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (1,2) rectangle (2,3);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (1,0) rectangle (2,1);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2,-0.5) {正方体的展开图};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.5cm]", "  \\draw[gray!40, thin] (0,0) grid (4,3);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,1) rectangle (1,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (1,1) rectangle (2,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (2,1) rectangle (3,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (3,1) rectangle (4,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,2) rectangle (1,3);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0) rectangle (1,1);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2,-0.5) {另一种正确的展开图};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=15cm]", "  \\draw[gray!40, thin] (0,0) grid (4,3);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (0,1) rectangle (1,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (1,1) rectangle (2,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (2,1) rectangle (3,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (3,1) rectangle (4,2);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (0,2) rectangle (1,3);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (1,2) rectangle (2,3);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2,-0.5) {不是展开图！（为什么？）};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}